    "detailed_description": "7D Maze is a challenging, mind-bending, puzzle game that explores the 7 dimensions. Using a unique, limited movement system, dash through a series of increasingly complex labyrinths.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>70 Challenging Levels: Increasing complexity with each new labyrinth.<br><br></li><li>7 Dimensions: Adds a new, mind-bending layer to the 2D-puzzle genre.<br><br></li><li>Casual, minimalist gameplay: Incredibly easy to learn, pick-up, and play!<br><br></li><li>Adaptive music: Enjoy the relaxing, acoustic chillstep.</li></ul>",
